    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/830e0a5f27695cd381935848d7cc5843.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=932 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where greed surpasses fear, only the cleverest will endure. Design your own dungeon\u2014a lethal snare for anyone who dares to be tempted by your riches. Clever traps, merciless creatures, and complex mazes \u2014 all crafted to thwart intruders. Alternatively, take a chance by exploring other players' dungeons, evading deadly traps and claiming their treasures. But remember \u2014 death in this world is not final, it's merely another lost opportunity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/6b01b275bd5529628db7e02291cd5395.webp?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/4f26e19345233cf9a821484cc3074f6f.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/4f26e19345233cf9a821484cc3074f6f.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/4f26e19345233cf9a821484cc3074f6f.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use modules to create intricate labyrinths filled with traps and monsters. Each module has a unique shape, structure, and atmosphere, featuring parkour zones and hidden rooms. Build a dungeon where every step is a risk, every turn is a trap, and anyone who dares to enter becomes a part of your game. But remember \u2013 the best dungeon doesn\u2019t just stop intruders. It instills fear in them before they even take their first step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/213c9fe9a2818a7edb5ad867851762d4.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/213c9fe9a2818a7edb5ad867851762d4.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/213c9fe9a2818a7edb5ad867851762d4.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/16b6bd49e86abc7e40b117270616c8f1.webp?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/5836bdfae96353f8a867761f396720d2.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/5836bdfae96353f8a867761f396720d2.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/5836bdfae96353f8a867761f396720d2.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into dungeons created by other players, use parkour to leap over deadly obstacles and traps, and choose your tactics in intense battles. Every move matters\u2014your survival depends on the precise and timely use of your equipment. Navigate through dangerous corridors, evade lethal mechanisms, and face off against monsters guarding the treasures. But remember\u2014one mistake, and you lose everything: your character and your loot will remain trapped in the catacombs forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/7237c0abb962bb978c09a7ff5e822751.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/7237c0abb962bb978c09a7ff5e822751.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/7237c0abb962bb978c09a7ff5e822751.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/898c54d4be4e40d6562c8a439ec986b1.webp?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious and cunning rogues, charismatic scoundrels, and brilliant tricksters. Tricksters always walk the fine line between life and death, gambling with fate and testing their luck. With the unique ability to inhabit the executed bodies of other tricksters, you can feel alive once more. Take a deep breath and dare to slip into the most treacherous catacombs in pursuit of a tempting and generous reward. Gather your gear and supplies\u2014they will be your key to success in completing the final mission of your new vessel\u2019s existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/ac5dca8cd81700d8f107af71e5272949.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=342 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where greed surpasses fear, only the cleverest will endure. Design your own dungeon\u2014a lethal snare for anyone who dares to be tempted by your riches. Clever traps, merciless creatures, and complex mazes \u2014 all crafted to thwart intruders. Alternatively, take a chance by exploring other players' dungeons, evading deadly traps and claiming their treasures. But remember \u2014 death in this world is not final, it's merely another lost opportunity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/6b01b275bd5529628db7e02291cd5395.webp?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/4f26e19345233cf9a821484cc3074f6f.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/4f26e19345233cf9a821484cc3074f6f.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/4f26e19345233cf9a821484cc3074f6f.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use modules to create intricate labyrinths filled with traps and monsters. Each module has a unique shape, structure, and atmosphere, featuring parkour zones and hidden rooms. Build a dungeon where every step is a risk, every turn is a trap, and anyone who dares to enter becomes a part of your game. But remember \u2013 the best dungeon doesn\u2019t just stop intruders. It instills fear in them before they even take their first step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/213c9fe9a2818a7edb5ad867851762d4.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/213c9fe9a2818a7edb5ad867851762d4.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/213c9fe9a2818a7edb5ad867851762d4.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/16b6bd49e86abc7e40b117270616c8f1.webp?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/5836bdfae96353f8a867761f396720d2.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/5836bdfae96353f8a867761f396720d2.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/5836bdfae96353f8a867761f396720d2.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into dungeons created by other players, use parkour to leap over deadly obstacles and traps, and choose your tactics in intense battles. Every move matters\u2014your survival depends on the precise and timely use of your equipment. Navigate through dangerous corridors, evade lethal mechanisms, and face off against monsters guarding the treasures. But remember\u2014one mistake, and you lose everything: your character and your loot will remain trapped in the catacombs forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/7237c0abb962bb978c09a7ff5e822751.poster.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/7237c0abb962bb978c09a7ff5e822751.webm?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/7237c0abb962bb978c09a7ff5e822751.mp4?t=1748087882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/898c54d4be4e40d6562c8a439ec986b1.webp?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious and cunning rogues, charismatic scoundrels, and brilliant tricksters. Tricksters always walk the fine line between life and death, gambling with fate and testing their luck. With the unique ability to inhabit the executed bodies of other tricksters, you can feel alive once more. Take a deep breath and dare to slip into the most treacherous catacombs in pursuit of a tempting and generous reward. Gather your gear and supplies\u2014they will be your key to success in completing the final mission of your new vessel\u2019s existence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/ac5dca8cd81700d8f107af71e5272949.avif?t=1748087882\" width=616 height=342 /></span></p>",
